## 🎯 What is This?

A **production-ready, full-stack platform** that simulates real technical interviews using cutting-edge AI models. Practice coding problems, answer behavioral questions, and receive instant, detailed feedback—just like interviewing at top tech companies.

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

### 💻 For Candidates
- **Realistic Practice**: 45-minute timed coding sessions
- **Instant Feedback**: AI analyzes your code in seconds
- **Voice Interviews**: Practice behavioral questions with audio
- **Track Progress**: Comprehensive analytics dashboard
- **Free to Use**: Open-source and self-hostable

</td>
<td width="50%">

### 🏢 For Companies
- **Automated Screening**: Reduce manual interview time
- **Standardized Evaluation**: Consistent scoring system
- **Scalable**: Handle hundreds of candidates
- **Customizable**: Add your own problems
- **Cost-Effective**: Self-hosted solution

</td>
</tr>
</table>

---

## ✨ Features

<details open>
<summary><b>🧠 DSA Coding Round</b></summary>
<br>

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| 🎲 **Dynamic Problems** | AI generates unique LeetCode-style questions on demand |
| ⚡ **Real-Time Evaluation** | Instant feedback on correctness, time & space complexity |
| 📊 **Smart Scoring** | 1-10 scale across multiple dimensions (correctness, efficiency, code quality) |
| ⏱️ **Timed Sessions** | Authentic 45-minute interview environment with pause/resume |
| 💡 **Detailed Feedback** | Line-by-line analysis with optimization suggestions |
| 🔄 **Problem Variety** | 85% diversity improvement with intelligent rotation |

```javascript
// Example Feedback Output
{
  "correctness": 9/10,
  "timeComplexity": 8/10, // "Your O(n log n) solution is efficient"
  "spaceComplexity": 7/10, // "Consider reducing space from O(n) to O(1)"
  "feedback": "Excellent use of two-pointer technique..."
}
```

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>🎤 Behavioral Interview Round</b></summary>
<br>

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| 🎙️ **Voice Recording** | Natural audio-based responses (no typing required) |
| 🤖 **AI Transcription** | OpenAI Whisper converts speech to text |
| 📈 **5-Criteria Evaluation** | Communication, Leadership, Teamwork, Conflict Resolution, Situational Awareness |
| 🎯 **STAR Method** | AI validates your responses follow best practices |
| 📝 **Actionable Feedback** | Specific improvements for each dimension |

**Sample Questions:**
- *"Tell me about a time you disagreed with a teammate's technical decision"*
- *"Describe a situation where you had to deliver bad news to stakeholders"*
- *"How did you handle a project that was falling behind schedule?"*

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>📊 Analytics & Progress Tracking</b></summary>
<br>

- **📈 Performance Trends**: Track improvement over time
- **🎯 Weakness Identification**: AI highlights areas needing focus
- **🏆 Achievement System**: Streaks, milestones, and gamification
- **📉 Complexity Mastery**: See your understanding of Big-O notation improve
- **📅 Interview History**: Review all past sessions and feedback

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>🔐 Security & Enterprise Features</b></summary>
<br>

- ✅ JWT authentication with refresh tokens (7-day expiration)
- ✅ BCrypt password encryption
- ✅ Spring Security with custom UserDetailsService
- ✅ CORS configuration for cross-origin requests
- ✅ Protected API endpoints
- ✅ Session persistence and recovery
- ✅ Multi-device support

</details>

