### AI Models Integration

| Model | Provider | Purpose | Performance |
|-------|----------|---------|-------------|
| 🦙 **LLaMA 3.1 (8B)** | Groq | Code evaluation & problem generation | Sub-2s response time |
| 🎙️ **Whisper (large-v3)** | OpenAI | Audio transcription | 95%+ accuracy |
| 🤖 **Claude Sonnet 4** | Anthropic | Alternative evaluation (optional) | High-quality feedback |

