## ⚡ Quick Start

### Prerequisites

```bash
✅ Java 17+
✅ Node.js 18+
✅ PostgreSQL 14+
✅ Maven 3.8+
```

### 🚀 One-Command Setup (Coming Soon)

```bash
# Clone and run with Docker Compose
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/ai-interview-platform.git
cd ai-interview-platform
docker-compose up
```

### 📦 Manual Installation

<details>
<summary><b>Click to expand installation steps</b></summary>

#### 1️⃣ Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/ai-interview-platform.git
cd ai-interview-platform
```

#### 2️⃣ Setup Backend

```bash
cd backend

# Create database
createdb interview_platform

# Configure environment
cp src/main/resources/application.properties.example src/main/resources/application.properties

# Edit with your credentials
nano src/main/resources/application.properties
```

**application.properties:**
```properties
# Database
spring.datasource.url=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/interview_platform
spring.datasource.username=your_username
spring.datasource.password=your_password

# JWT Secret (generate with: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(64).toString('base64'))")
SECRET_KEY=your_generated_secret_key

# API Keys
spring.ai.openai.api-key=${OPENAI_API_KEY}
spring.ai.groq.api-key=${GROQ_API_KEY}
```

```bash
# Build and run
mvn clean install
mvn spring-boot:run
```

✅ Backend running on `http://localhost:8080`

#### 3️⃣ Setup Frontend

```bash
cd frontend

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Configure environment
cp .env.example .env
nano .env
```

**.env:**
```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
```

```bash
# Start development server
npm run dev
```

✅ Frontend running on `http://localhost:5173`

#### 4️⃣ Get API Keys

| Service | Link | Cost |
|---------|------|------|
| Groq (LLaMA) | [console.groq.com](https://console.groq.com/) | Free tier available |
| OpenAI (Whisper) | [platform.openai.com](https://platform.openai.com/) | Pay-as-you-go |
| Anthropic (Optional) | [console.anthropic.com](https://console.anthropic.com/) | Free tier available |

</details>

