## 📖 Documentation

### API Endpoints

<details>
<summary><b>Authentication</b></summary>

#### Register
```http
POST /api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}
```

#### Login
```http
POST /api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
}
```

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>DSA Problem Generation</b></summary>

```http
GET /api/dsa-problem
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "title": "Two Sum",
  "leetcodeUrl": "https://leetcode.com/problems/two-sum/",
  "difficulty": "EASY",
  "tags": "Array,Hash Table",
  "problemStatement": "Given an array of integers nums and an integer target...",
  "testCases": "Input: nums = [2,7,11,15], target = 9\nOutput: [0,1]"
}
```

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>Code Evaluation</b></summary>

```http
POST /api/user/dsa-evaluation
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usercode": "class Solution {\n    public int[] twoSum(int[] nums, int target) {...}",
  "userid": 1,
  "problem": "Given an array of integers nums..."
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "correctness": 9,
  "timeComplexity": 10,
  "spaceComplexity": 8,
  "feedback": "Excellent solution! Your use of HashMap achieves O(n) time complexity..."
}
```

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>Behavioral Interview</b></summary>

#### Get Question
```http
GET /api/behavioralquestion
```

**Response:**
```
"Tell me about a time when you had to resolve a conflict within your team."
```

#### Submit Audio Response
```http
POST /api/user/behaviour
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

question: "Tell me about a time..."
audio: <audio-file.webm>
userId: 1
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "overallScore": 8.4,
  "communication": 9,
  "situationalAwareness": 8,
  "leadershipSkills": 8,
  "teamworkAbility": 9,
  "conflictResolution": 8,
  "overallFeedback": "Strong response demonstrating clear communication..."
}
```

</details>

### Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    A[React Frontend] -->|REST API| B[Spring Boot Backend]
    B -->|JPA/Hibernate| C[(PostgreSQL)]
    B -->|HTTP| D[Groq API - LLaMA 3.1]
    B -->|HTTP| E[OpenAI API - Whisper]
    B -->|HTTP| F[Anthropic API - Claude]
    
    subgraph "Backend Services"
        B --> G[DSA Evaluation Service]
        B --> H[Behavioral Evaluation Service]
        B --> I[User Management Service]
        B --> J[JWT Authentication]
    end
    
    subgraph "Frontend Components"
        A --> K[DSA Round Page]
        A --> L[Behavioral Round Page]
        A --> M[Dashboard]
        A --> N[Analytics]
    end
```

